{
  "title": "Aromatic Indian Lentil Curry",
  "description": "A comforting and earthy curry featuring lentils and a hint of vanilla, perfect for a lazy Sunday, this dish is made with agemono-deep-fry technique and can be served raw-friendly in a ramekin.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "diet": [
    "vegetarian",
